quiz.prompt:
With the chip lying flat, the raw ax value is 8192 (0.5 g), but the screen shows 0.00. Which line is wrong?

```
int16_t ax = oku16();
float g = ax / 16384;
Serial.println(g, 2);
```

The chip is speeding up horizontally without tilting: ax = 0.3 g and az = 1.0 g are read. What does this code print?

```
float pitch = atan2(0.3, 1.0) * 180.0 / PI;
Serial.println(pitch, 1);
```
